Sub-ETL-1 canonical CSV output directory.

Per Q-DEC verbal sign-off 2026-05-12 (PR #330): raw + canonical restaurant chain data
is gitignored. This .gitkeep preserves the directory tree so first-time runs of
scripts/etl/normalize_restaurant_chains.py find the expected output root.

Contents written by `scripts/etl/normalize_restaurant_chains.py` at runtime:
  data/imports/restaurant-chains/<factory_id>/<report_type>/<period>.csv

NOT committed to git. Run the normalizer locally to populate.
